            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR includes three new pages:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule-style</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule-width</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Gaps\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS gaps module page</a> is already live.<br>\nThe <code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule-color</code> is merged. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4718740506\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44549\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44549/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44549\">#44549</a>)<br>\nThis page is already linked to from those two pages and from <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/row-rule-visibility-items#see_also\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule-visibility-items</code></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4718339915\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/project/issues/238/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238\">openwebdocs/project#238</a></p>",
