        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229193143?u=925b41266d876925b08ce78352f0d5d24c4a6c71&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;style&gt;</code> element documentation to clarify that the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;style&gt;</code> element is not limited to the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;head&gt;</code> element.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The page now explains that <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;style&gt;</code> can be used wherever metadata content is permitted, such as inside a <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;template&gt;</code> element, in accordance with the HTML specification.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41900.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3611920061\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41900\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41900/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41900\">#41900</a></p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Example</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Using <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;style&gt;</code> inside <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;template&gt;</code></h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;style&gt;</code> element can also be placed inside a {{HTMLElement(\"template\")}} element because it accepts metadata content.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;template id=&quot;card-template&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;style&gt;\n    p {\n      color: rebeccapurple;\n    }\n  &lt;/style&gt;\n\n  &lt;p&gt;Styled template content&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">template</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">card-template</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">style</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span> {\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">color</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> rebeccapurple;\n    }\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">style</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>Styled template content<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">template</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span></pre></div>\n\n\n\n",
