        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 150 adds the restriction whereby app system accent colors (<code class=\"notranslate\">AccentColor</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">AccentColorText</code> CSS keywords, and <code class=\"notranslate\">accent-color: auto</code> ) are limited to installed web apps, and only in the user's initial profile context.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5106043975761920\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5106043975761920</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that this is not specified behavior; this is an optional restriction that browsers may choose to interpret how they want (see the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#css-system-colors:~:text=User%20agents%20may,user\" rel=\"nofollow\">spec wording</a>). I have therefore chosen to cover this change in general notes, and point to the BCD for specific browser behaviors.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See the related BCD update: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4857269991\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30025\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30025/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30025\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30025</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44678",
            "title": "Technical review: Add notes about web app scope system accent color",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-13T11:38:12.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-10T18:02:08.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31079227?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated the parrots.jpg image from the elements/map documentation to match the size specified by said documentation (350x150).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The area circles were slightly displaced and therefore not matching the right corner properly like they should where the image the dimensions the docs specify and using the coordinates they use because of that.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/map\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/map</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n\n\n\n",
